# A guard sees the client trespass (Remnants TrespassingCrime_15 near -1468,172, Hadewin): the client's AI-less copy is
# told it saw the crime (GuardReach Witness), and the warning plays on the client's screen only.

include session.coop
# Midday: Hadewin at his post by the volume (a guard beyond 600 units sees nothing).
A run DayTime 12
B expect time contains "hour=12." timeout=15
sleep 5
B tpinto TrespassingCrime_15
# The volume loads by camera, which lags a teleport.
B expect inside TrespassingCrime_15 contains "loaded=1" timeout=20
# And wait for the camp: copies are placed from the host once the player arrives.
B expect actors 400 contains "NPC_Hadewin" timeout=40
B walk 0 0.2 0.5
B ?inside TrespassingCrime_15
B actors 700
B expect counter guardwitness >= 1 timeout=20
B expect dialogue contains "CrimeWarning" timeout=10
A expect dialogue contains "in=0" timeout=1
B actors 600
A shot
B shot
